Maintainer: Pragmatic AI Labs <hello@paiml.com>
Description: Zero-config AI context generation and code quality toolkit with Claude Code Agent Mode
 PMAT (Pragmatic AI MCP Agent Toolkit) is a zero-configuration AI context
 generation system with extreme quality enforcement and Toyota Way standards.
 .
 It provides both on-demand analysis and continuous background monitoring
 through Claude Code Agent Mode integration with Claude Code via the Model
 Context Protocol (MCP).
 .
 Key Features:
  * Claude Code Agent Mode with continuous quality monitoring
  * AI context generation optimized for LLM workflows
  * Code complexity analysis with AST precision (30+ languages)
  * Technical debt detection with SATD analysis
  * Quality gates with Toyota Way ≤20 complexity enforcement
  * Real-time file system monitoring with instant feedback
  * Production-ready systemd service deployment
  * Multi-language support via tree-sitter parsing
 .
 Perfect for developers using Claude Code who want zero-config AI context
 generation and continuous code quality monitoring.
